OL,3,GNEWSAIndustry leaders discuss island
OL,4,Ahigh value scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 260 industry leaders from
OL,7,Fbusiness, finance and law have held a
OL,8,Fmeeting to discuss the role high value
OL,9,Fresidents play in Jersey's economy.
OL,11,FJersey's high value residency programme
OL,12,Fgrants residential status to highly
OL,13,Fskilled and economically active high
OL,14,Fnet worth individuals.
OL,16,FOne attendee at the Chamber of Commerce
OL,17,Flunch on Thursday, Mary O'Keeffe, said
OL,18,Fhigh value residents "were extremely
OL,19,Fimportant" to the island.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
